  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>At constant pressure :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>nC</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>160</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>nC</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn></math>&nbsp; .....(1)</p><p>At constant volume</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>nC</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>240</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>nC</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>100</mn></math>......(2)</p><p>Equation (1) divided by (2)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>160</mn><mn>240</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
